From 481721d59f51daaacc7adf021562807af938e9e4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: chenjinhu <chenjinhu@fumobi.com>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 01:12:39 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Unify startup identity, authenticated routing and stable
 fingerprint readbacks

Add endpoint-bound HTTP and SOCKS5 authentication, proxy API bootstrap and health checks, pre-connect local-address restrictions and native DNT/TLS policy. Resolve IP region before navigation and acknowledge native renderer locale/timezone changes before commit. Share IP data with permission-preserving geolocation.

Add typed startup configuration, stable seeds and Android template validation. Unify supported Canvas/WebGL/PBO pixel exports, AudioBuffer/analyser reads, local font and actual voice filtering, and binding-only Element/Range geometry protection. Reject invalid startup files with a blocking network policy. Defaults remain native.

Validate with real Chromium configuration/region tests, 42 network/authentication/transport tests, actual URLLoader/Mojo geolocation tests, the existing sanitizer regressions, include/GN dependency checks and Android arm64 compilation. Device execution remains to be validated.

